{"version":1,"content":"<p>特首會同行政會議10月13日批准天星小輪提高旗下「中環－尖沙咀」和「灣仔－尖沙嘴」兩條專營渡輪航線的票價，加幅為平日每程0.6元至1.0元，以及周末每程1.0元至1.8元，較天星小輪申請的加價幅度低；</p><p>月票票價則維持在190元。</p><p>新票價於明年1月25日開始生效。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:00:09.795780+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:17:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T13:17:46.891002+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:57:38.528411+00:00","content_hash":"5276ac51f82ff9890f7e479c1de2b47ae2bff8579e98629c6cf08d0f4d2b72a6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}